# Normalise line endings on commit. The working copy is Windows and the whole
# app is one 2,796-line index.html that every diff lands in — a single CRLF
# round-trip would rewrite all of it and bury a real change in noise. Git
# stores LF; checkout still gets whatever the platform wants.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary, so git never tries to normalise or diff them as text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
